    "commit": "4ba749de",
    "summary": "Links and code references are clickable in the chat and the review pane. A shared link step (vscode-plugin/src/chat/link-markup.ts) wraps code references and moves http(s) addresses to data-url with no href; one delegated click posts open-link or open-code-ref; and a host opener (vscode-plugin/src/chat/link-opener.ts) validates the target and opens it, in the review pane's editor group, else Beside. The path check is shared with the companion reader through resolveWithin (vscode-plugin/src/chat/companion-reader.ts). The browser open is vscode.env.openExternal, documented at https://code.visualstudio.com/api/references/vscode-api#env (click this link in the review pane to check it opens once)."
  }
